Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://kubeos.in/

Package: kubeos-dashboard
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, ca-certificates
Description: the KubeOS web dashboard (Headlamp-based, run as host services)
 The dashboard payload: a Headlamp server build with the KubeOS plugin, plus the console
 and the authenticating gateway, all run as systemd services on the node instead of as
 Pods, because a KubeOS base system runs no Pods at all.
 .
 The package ships the release archive the way the ISO used to, so
 kubeos-dashboard-install - which verifies its checksum, unpacks it and runs the
 release's own installer at first boot - needs no change: updates arrive through apt
 instead of through a new ISO.
